{"version":"https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1","title":"少治法 - 标签","description":"这里不仅是我研习中医经典的私人书斋，更是一处致力于 “观照经典以明医理，颐养身心以扶正气” 的清净之地。","home_page_url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","language":"zh-CN","icon":"https://acuherb.xyz/apple-touch-icon.png","favicon":"https://acuherb.xyz/favicon.ico","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://acuherb.xyz/images/avatar.png"}],"items":[{"title":"少治法：论少年人宜治脾胃","date_published":"2026-05-30T19:55:52&#43;08:00","date_modified":"2026-05-30T19:59:52&#43;08:00","id":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-6-shaozhifa/","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/posts/4-6-shaozhifa/","authors":[{"name":"Acuherb","url":"https://acuherb.xyz/","avatar":"https://gravatar.loli.net/avatar/89719985bb81a6f9d508808413f1b999?s=32&amp;d=mp"}],"tags":["少治法","少年人宜治脾胃"],"summary":"本节为《石室秘录》“少治法”部分，专论少年人血气方刚的调治法则。核心思想是：少年人不可动用补血，当以健运脾胃为主，随症加减，使药力不伤胃气而易于奏功。","content_html":"本节为《石室秘录》“少治法”部分，专论\u003cstrong\u003e少年人血气方刚\u003c/strong\u003e的调治法则。核心思想是：\u003cstrong\u003e少年人不可动用补血，当以健运脾胃为主，随症加减，使药力不伤胃气而易于奏功\u003c/strong\u003e。"}]}